    {
      "id": "cb_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -284
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Contour blobs\n\nSeven random circles, merged by Shape Boolean (union) into one blob. A second ForEach offsets that outline 18 times, from 36 px out to 66 px in (Path Ops, `offset`), each ring a little bluer.\n\nTry another scatter seed, or `miter` joins on Path Ops.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 220
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Contour blobs\n\nSeven random circles, merged by Shape Boolean (union) into one blob. A second ForEach offsets that outline 18 times, from 36 px out to 66 px in (Path Ops, `offset`), each ring a little bluer.\n\nTry another scatter seed, or `miter` joins on Path Ops.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 220
      }
    },
